      3 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سالبهُ الشَّىْءَ</span></b> , if used, means <i>He contended
with him in a mutual endeavour to seize,</i> or <i>carry
off, the thing by force.</i> See 6.]

